{
  "tema": 7172,
  "slug": "quisiera-querria",
  "titulo": "Quisiera / querría for I would like",
  "subtitulo": "Quisiera abrir una cuenta.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "For a polite would like, use quisiera (imperfect subjunctive) or querría (conditional); they mean the same. Me gustaría is more common in conversation. In Mexico quisiera is far more frequent than querría.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To ask or offer very politely, Spanish uses **quisiera** or **querría** + noun or infinitive: _I would like_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Quisiera** is technically the imperfect subjunctive, but here it works like a conditional. Both are correct and formal."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**In Mexico**, **quisiera** is the common one; **querría** sounds bookish. In everyday talk, **me gustaría** is the most frequent of all."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **quisiera** is _I want_ wearing a tie."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==Quisiera== otra copa de vino, señor?",
              "en": "Would you like another glass of wine, sir?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Querría== otra copa de vino, señor?",
              "en": "Would you like another glass of wine, sir?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Quisiera== abrir una cuenta.",
              "en": "I'd like to open an account."
            },
            {
              "es": "Yo ==quisiera== dedicarles más tiempo a mis hijos, pero estoy tan ocupada...",
              "en": "I'd like to spend more time with my kids, but I'm so busy..."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis papás ==querrían== comprar una casa en la playa.",
              "en": "My parents would like to buy a house at the beach."
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==quisiera== interrumpirlos, pero es urgente.",
              "en": "I wouldn't want to interrupt you, but it's urgent."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Me gustaría== reservar una mesa para cuatro.",
              "en": "I'd like to book a table for four."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
